    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2020 the Syndicate's opening gross claims outstanding (closing 2019) was USD 4,274.9m. The reported result includes net prior year reserve releases of USD 49.8m, reflecting favourable claims development and improved underlying claims experience across the Direct portfolio. This net release reduced the combined ratio by 3.5%. Despite these releases, 2020 experienced significant major loss activity (multiple US windstorms and COVID-19 related losses) which materially affected the underwriting result.",
